    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29679" root="عظم" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَظْمِىٌّ</span></b>  [in the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَظْمٰى</span>, but it is a rel. n.,]
A pigeon <i>inclining to whiteness;</i> (K, TA;) app.
so called in relation to the bone (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَظْم</span>), by
reason of its whiteness. (TA.)

